# 🧠 16. Managed Identity कहाँ आती है?

Managed Identity भी workload identity का एक तरीका है।

Common types:

```text
System-assigned
User-assigned
```

लेकिन App Registration और Managed Identity same object model नहीं हैं।

Important distinction:

```text
App Registration
→ Application Object
→ Service Principal
```

Managed Identity:

```text
Managed Identity
→ Service Principal
```

Microsoft documentation explicitly बताती है कि managed identities में application object नहीं होता; वे service principal object के रूप में represented होती हैं।

---

# 🆚 17. App Registration vs Managed Identity

| Feature                         | App Registration | Managed Identity |
| ------------------------------- | ---------------- | ---------------- |
| Application Object              | Yes              | No               |
| Service Principal               | Yes              | Yes              |
| Azure-managed credentials       | Not inherently   | Yes              |
| WIF                             | Yes              | Yes              |
| User-assigned reusable identity | No               | Yes              |
| Application configuration       | Rich             | Different model  |

