# 🧠 38. Why Exact Matching?

मान लो:

```text
Configured Subject:
ABC123
```

लेकिन incoming token:

```text
ABC124
```

तो:

```text
ABC123 ≠ ABC124
```

Trust match नहीं होगा।

Result:

```text
❌ Token Exchange Failed
```

Microsoft Entra federation matching case-sensitive होती है।

