# ❌ 43. Authentication Failure

Example:

```text
AADSTS70025
Client application has no configured federated identity credentials
```

Meaning:

```text
App
 ↓
Federated Credential
 ↓
❌ Missing
```

Microsoft's troubleshooting documentation specifically identifies missing federated credentials as a cause of this error.

---

# ❌ 44. Issuer / Subject Mismatch

Possible error:

```text
No matching federated identity record found
```

Check:

```text
Issuer
Subject
```

Microsoft documentation specifically recommends checking whether the issuer URL or federation subject matches.

